WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.062
Before using a scalar subquery ask three questions
Does it return

00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:12.521
one column Can it ever return more than one row And

00:00:12.547 --> 00:00:18.129
what should happen if it returns no row This small
checklist catches most

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:20.932
scalar-subquery problems before you run the query
